OL,3,GNEWSAPoundland collapse crazy, says
OL,4,Afirm's founder
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe founder of Poundland says the firm
OL,7,Ffalling into administration is a
OL,8,F"crazy" situation, after the current
OL,9,Fowners failed to secure a takeover
OL,10,Fdeal, but he hoped thousand of jobs
OL,11,Fcould still be saved.
OL,13,FAbout 11,000 are at risk across the
OL,14,Fdiscount chain's 600 stores and
OL,15,FWalsall-based headquarters.
OL,17,FSteve Smith started the business 36
OL,18,Fyears ago from an office in the town
OL,19,Fand said he felt the collapse did not
OL,20,Fneed to happen.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
