OL,3,GNEWSAPoundland collapse crazy, says
OL,4,Afirm's founder
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's devastating and this could have
OL,7,Fbeen avoided," he said, adding: "With
OL,8,Fbuyers on the table, I just can't
OL,9,Fbelieve a deal wasn't done."
